          "lastRun": "integrated_multimodal_description: [Shot 1] Live-action, cinematic close-up vlog style, a beautiful 20-year-old Romanian woman fills the frame from the shoulders up, looking directly into the lens as if filming herself with a phone at arm’s length. She has long glossy black hair, clear natural makeup, expressive eyes, and two anatomically real white rabbit ears growing naturally from the top of her head instead of human ears, with soft fur and subtle muscle-driven movement at their bases. In a natural outdoor setting with softly blurred greenery in the background, she keeps steady eye contact, lifts one hand to play gently with the front section of her hair, and gives a small relaxed smile; as she moves, one rabbit ear turns slightly outward, the other twitches once, and both ears rise and settle naturally. She adds a light playful head tilt while the handheld camera holds a tight close-up with small amplitude, ending with her fingers resting lightly in her hair and her gaze still fixed on the viewer.\n\noverall_soundscape: Soft natural outdoor ambience with a faint breeze, distant leaves moving gently, subtle hair and clothing rustle, and quiet natural breathing.\n\nnon_diegetic_music: Light acoustic guitar plucks at a gentle mid-tempo with a soft warm synth pad underneath, kept low in volume and steady throughout."
